sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Ingress as Platform Ingress<br/>(Gateway / kube-rbac-proxy)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant HTTP as OVMS HTTP Frontend<br/>(Drogon)<br/>rest_port/TCP HTTP
    participant GRPC as OVMS gRPC Frontend<br/>port/TCP gRPC
    participant Auth as Auth Handler<br/>(v3 only)
    participant SM as ServableManagerModule
    participant MP as MediaPipe Graph<br/>(v3 LLM/Embeddings)
    participant OV as OpenVINO Runtime<br/>(in-process)
    participant GenAI as OpenVINO GenAI<br/>(in-process)
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Storage as Cloud Storage<br/>(S3/GCS/Azure)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 1: HTTP REST Inference (v1/v2)
    Client->>Ingress: POST /v2/models/{name}/infer<br/>Auth: Platform auth
    Ingress->>HTTP: Forward (pod-internal)<br/>No encryption
    HTTP->>SM: Route to model
    SM->>OV: Execute inference (in-process)
    OV-->>SM: Inference result
    SM-->>HTTP: Response
    HTTP-->>Ingress: JSON response
    Ingress-->>Client: HTTPS response

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 2: gRPC Inference (KServe v2)
    Client->>Ingress: ModelInfer RPC<br/>Auth: Platform auth
    Ingress->>GRPC: Forward (pod-internal)<br/>No encryption
    GRPC->>SM: Route to model
    SM->>OV: Execute inference (in-process)
    OV-->>SM: Inference result
    SM-->>GRPC: Response
    GRPC-->>Ingress: gRPC response
    Ingress-->>Client: HTTPS/gRPC response

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 3: OpenAI Chat Completions (v3 SSE)
    Client->>Ingress: POST /v3/chat/completions<br/>Auth: Platform auth
    Ingress->>HTTP: Forward (pod-internal)
    HTTP->>Auth: Validate Bearer Token
    Auth-->>HTTP: Token valid
    HTTP->>MP: Route to LLM Calculator
    MP->>GenAI: Generate tokens (continuous batching)
    loop Token streaming
        GenAI-->>MP: Next token
        MP-->>HTTP: SSE event
        HTTP-->>Ingress: text/event-stream chunk
        Ingress-->>Client: Streamed token
    end
    GenAI-->>MP: [DONE]
    MP-->>HTTP: SSE complete
    HTTP-->>Ingress: Stream end
    Ingress-->>Client: Stream end

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 4: Model Pulling from HuggingFace
    Note right of SM: On startup or --pull flag
    SM->>HF: HTTPS clone (libgit2)<br/>Auth: HF Token (Bearer)
    HF-->>SM: Model artifacts (Git LFS)
    SM->>SM: Store to local filesystem
    SM->>OV: Load model

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 5: Model Loading from Cloud Storage
    SM->>Storage: HTTPS GET (SDK)<br/>Auth: IAM / ADC / Connection string
    Storage-->>SM: Model artifacts
    SM->>OV: Load model
